Here are some examples written based on the SmartPrompt framework:

The code for some of the known workers is as follows:

```Ruby
SmartPrompt.define_worker :answer do
  use "ollama"
  model "llama3.2"
  prompt :answer, {prompt_doc: params[:prompt_doc], prompt: params[:prompt]}
  send_msg
end
```

```Ruby
require "numo/narray"

SmartPrompt.define_worker :get_embedding do
  use "siliconflow"
  model "BAAI/bge-large-zh-v1.5"
  prompt params[:text]
  result = embeddings
  x = Numo::NArray.cast(result[0..params[:length] - 1])
  norm = Math.sqrt((x * x).sum)
  (x / norm).to_a
end
```

```Ruby
SmartPrompt.define_worker :smart_agent do
  use "siliconflow"
  model "Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-7B-Instruct"
  prompt :smart_agent, {input: params[:text]}
  send_msg
end
```

The code for some of the known templates is as follows:

```ERB
    按下面提供的文档和步骤来回答接下来的问题：
    (1) 首先，分析文档中的内容，看是否与问题相关
    (2) 其次，只能用文档中的内容进行回复,越详细越好
    (3) 最后，根据问题与输入的文档，整理内容，以自然语言回答问题

    文档:
    """"
    &lt;%= prompt_doc %&gt;
    """"

    问题: &lt;%= prompt %&gt;
```

